OL,3,GNEWSAReplica Christopher Columbus ship
OL,4,Awows in Douglas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA replica of Christopher Columbus's
OL,7,Fflagship, the Santa Maria, has sailed
OL,8,Finto Douglas harbour, attracting
OL,9,Fattention from residents and visitors
OL,10,Falong the quay.
OL,12,FThe replica was built in 2018 over an
OL,13,F18-month period and has been travelling
OL,14,Faround Britain and Ireland.
OL,16,FIt is expected to remain in Douglas
OL,17,Funtil 6 September, opening to the
OL,18,Fpublic as a floating museum.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
