OL,3,GNEWSAReplica Christopher Columbus ship
OL,4,Awows in Douglas
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrew member Diego Ibarroldo said, a
OL,7,Fcrew member from Asturias in northern
OL,8,FSpain, said it gave people a glimpse of
OL,9,Flife aboard the ship Columbus sailed in
OL,10,F1492.
